{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/graph"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"extension","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Graph","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:e:s:14GraphProtocols0A0P12ConnectivityE11kComponentsAD11KComponentsVyxGyF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Extended Protocol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"title":"Graph"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","text":"Graph","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/hasBridges","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isBiEdgeConnected","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isBiconnected","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/isConnected"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/articulationPoints()","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/